*INTERVIEWING QUESTIONS RELATED TO "WHICH REGIMENT DO YOU WANT TO JOIN*

1. Which regiment would you like to join, and why?
2. Why did you choose this regiment over the others?
3. What is the motto of your preferred regiment?
4. Where is the Regimental Centre of this regiment located?
5. What are the primary roles of this regiment?
6. What qualities do soldiers of this regiment need the most?
7. Name some famous battles or operations in which this regiment has participated.
8. Name one Param Vir Chakra or Ashok Chakra awardee from this regiment.
9. What is the war cry of this regiment?
10. What is the regimental insignia or cap badge?
11. What is unique about the traditions of this regiment?
12. If you are allotted a different regiment, will you still be happy? Why?
13. What is the difference between an Infantry Regiment and an Armoured Regiment?
14. Which regiment has the longest or most distinguished history in the Indian Army?
15. How are soldiers recruited into this regiment?
16. Which terrain does this regiment usually operate in?
17. Name the current Colonel of the Regiment (if known) or explain the role of a Colonel of the Regiment.
18. What recent operation or achievement of this regiment do you know about?
19. If you had to recommend this regiment to a friend, what would you tell him?
20. Apart from your preferred regiment, which other regiment would you like to join and why?
